  "description": {
    "text": "The fourth yearly Pokémon TCG Holiday Calendar, announced for 22 August 2025: 25 days of surprises, eight of them foil cards with a festive snowflake stamp. They reprint Scarlet & Violet cards with their numbers: Glaceon ex, two illustration rares, Crabominable and Vanillish, and five more in cosmos holo, Pikachu and Eevee among them.\n\nThe calendar also held six booster packs, seven three-card fun packs, two coins, two sticker sheets and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "ICv2: 'Pokemon TCG: Holiday Calendar 2025' Hits Preorder (9 June 2025)",
        "url": "https://icv2.com/articles/news/view/59746/pokemon-tcg-holiday-calendar-2025-hits-preorder"
      },
      {
        "title": "GoNintendo: Pokémon Trading Card Game Holiday Calendar 2025 pre-orders sell out",
        "url": "https://gonintendo.com/contents/49333-pokemon-trading-card-game-holiday-calendar-2025-pre-orders-sell-out-but-more-are"
      }
    ]
  },
